      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That might be very tricky to actually implement on a consistent basis. Some beta work with the live network and others don't. \n\nI don't use beta, but I had one day where it turned out that instances I created couldn't be joined by someone who was on the older version, they got an error when they tried to join me, but I was perfectly able to join them on their own instance and ask about it.\n\nThe way the beta usually work when they're not network compatible is that you only see people who are on the beta. \n\nI guess one thing that might be useful is a clear indication if you're using the latest version or not.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
